<title>CANADA: Newport Petroleum to issue 4 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Newport Petroleum to issue 4 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newport Petroleum Corp said on Thursday it agreed to issue four million common shares at C$6.85 a share for gross proceeds of C$27.4 million.</p>
<p>Closing is expected in early November.</p>
<p>The underwriting syndicate will be led by Peters &amp; Co Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
